            "review_title": "Review at Zenith Vegan Restaurant & Cafe",
            "review_text": "Thewanderer\nPitsburg, Ohio96 contributions\n0\nReally disappointed!\nDec 2019 • Couples\nWe had such great expectations for this place due to online reviews. Sadly it was a real let down. The pumpkin salad didn't actually have any salad, it was just mashed up pumpkin, bland and dull, my vegan GF left half of it. I had the hummus pizza - this was not a pizza, instead a small flatbread made soggy and wet by the hummus, topped with partially cooked vegetables. It was tiny, 120k VND for what must have cost 20k VND to make. All our food was luke‐warm and at 3pm they had no milk to make any coffee. I am surprised this place has received such good reviews!\nRead more\nWritten December 13, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
