            "review_title": "Review at Zenith Vegan Restaurant & Cafe",
            "review_text": "Duc Nguyen\n1 contribution\n0\nFriendly, get a way from busy area\nJun 2019\nI practice yoga at Zenith Yoga Studio in the second floor and usually come down to eat at Zenith Cafe. I love the vegeterian food here with both Vietnamese and European style. The food are made with care and healthy orientation because there are a lot of yogis eating here. There are a lot of foreigners here with their communities around as well. It's a great place for meeting friends or for couple dating, I think so. The atmosphere is friendly and cozy and calm. You can also borrow some books here, reading about yoga, meditation etc...\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 15, 2019",
            "rating": 4.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
