            "review_title": "Review at Zenith Vegan Restaurant & Cafe",
            "review_text": "Jas09\nvietnam9 contributions\n0\nHidden charm\nAug 2019 • Friends\nIt hid away in a small alley but the space is so niceee, so green and relaxing.\nThe vegan food is tastier than I expected! Love Mushroom sandwich !\nIts around 150 thousand vnd for a meal including fresh juice and detox juice\nThey have KOmbucha!!!\nWorth coming back, even to hang out to read a book!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 7, 2019",
